					<item>
				<guid>http://www.scpwiki.com/not-yet</guid>
				<title>Not Yet</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/not-yet</link>
				<description>

&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: right;&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Does she?&lt;br /&gt;
We ask trembling&lt;br /&gt;
Gazing upon the void&lt;br /&gt;
A hole in the vast sea of stars&lt;br /&gt;
Waiting&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Can she?&lt;br /&gt;
The answer a&lt;br /&gt;
Notion in lore unknown&lt;br /&gt;
So much was forgotten Somewhere&lt;br /&gt;
In time&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Should she?&lt;br /&gt;
None speak of this&lt;br /&gt;
Black thought born from despair&lt;br /&gt;
Though sickened we refuse to heed&lt;br /&gt;
Her voice&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Will she?&lt;br /&gt;
We strive to still&lt;br /&gt;
The advent of the last&lt;br /&gt;
Moon after moon her anguished cry&lt;br /&gt;
Rings forth&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Do we?&lt;br /&gt;
Truly fathom&lt;br /&gt;
The task undertaken&lt;br /&gt;
As we wait in dread for her child’s&lt;br /&gt;
Howl&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;by &lt;span class=&quot;printuser avatarhover&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/karnickel&quot;  &gt;&lt;img class=&quot;small&quot; src=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1226005&amp;amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;amp;timestamp=1608173783&quot; alt=&quot;Karnickel&quot; style=&quot;background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1226005)&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/karnickel&quot;  &gt;Karnickel&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
</description>
				<pubDate>Thu, 19 Mar 2020 01:09:58 +0000</pubDate>
												<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <div style="text-align: right;"></div> <p>Does she?<br /> We ask trembling<br /> Gazing upon the void<br /> A hole in the vast sea of stars<br /> Waiting</p> <p>Can she?<br /> The answer a<br /> Notion in lore unknown<br /> So much was forgotten Somewhere<br /> In time</p> <p>Should she?<br /> None speak of this<br /> Black thought born from despair<br /> Though sickened we refuse to heed<br /> Her voice</p> <p>Will she?<br /> We strive to still<br /> The advent of the last<br /> Moon after moon her anguished cry<br /> Rings forth</p> <p>Do we?<br /> Truly fathom<br /> The task undertaken<br /> As we wait in dread for her child’s<br /> Howl</p> <p>by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/karnickel" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1226005&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608173783" alt="Karnickel" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1226005)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/karnickel" >Karnickel</a></span></p> 
