						 <div style="text-align: right;"></div> <br /> <strong>Item #:</strong> SCP-5161 <p><strong>Object Class:</strong> <span style="text-decoration: line-through;">Safe</span> Euclid</p> <p><strong>Special Containment Procedures:</strong> SCP-5161 instances are to be contained in a standard humanoid containment cell. Containment cell is to be decorated as an ordinary living room, suitable for a child. SCP-5161 instances do not require sustenance as far as is currently known. It is advised to spray them once a week with water, to keep them clean and docile.</p> <p><span style="text-decoration: line-through;">Containment cell is to be monitored at all times by personnel with level two (2) or higher clearance. Camera use is installed</span>. Two armed guards are to be stationed outside of the containment cell. SCP-5161 instances require coloring materials such as pencils and papers to keep content. Personell are to check once a week if current materials do suffice, if not new ones must be delivered as soon as possible.</p> <p><strong>Description:</strong> <strong>SCP-5161-A</strong> is a full-grown broccoli (Brassica oleracea var. Italica) SCP-5161-A appears to be sapient and exhibits intelligence and common knowledge consistent with that of a human child aged 4 (four). Through testing, composition of the subject revealed no unusual qualities that make it discernible from a non-sapient broccoli. Instance shows signs of higher brain functions and is considered to be sapient. It is currently unknown how SCP-5161-A perceives the world, since no humanlike senses are to be found. Investigations are still ongoing.</p> <p>SCP-5161-A was discovered and brought into containment by Agent ████ █████ on ██/██/198█, who was at the time embedded as an undercover agent in █████, The Netherlands.</p> <p>SCP-5161-A is able to communicate through anomalous means. Current studies show SCP-5161-A is able to move items through telekinetic manner. Strength level shown in telekinetic episo