0" class="image" /></div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> <h3><span>IX - The Hermit: SCP-1440 - The Old Man from Nowhere</span></h3> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">+&nbsp;Show&nbsp;image</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">-&nbsp;Hide&nbsp;image</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"> <div style="border: 1px solid #000;"> <div style="height: 100%;"> <div class="image-container aligncenter"><img src="http://orig05.deviantart.net/8330/f/2015/278/f/a/09___the_hermit___scp_1440_by_sunnyclockwork-d9c0m0y.jpg" title="IX - The Hermit: SCP-1440 - The Old Man from Nowhere" alt="IX - The Hermit: SCP-1440 - The Old Man from Nowhere" width="400" class="image" /></div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> <h3><span>X - The Wheel of Fortune: Mekhane/The Broken God</span></h3> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">+&nbsp;Show&nbsp;image</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">-&nbsp;Hide&nbsp;image</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"> <div style="border: 1px solid #000;"> <div style="height: 100%;"> <div class="image-container aligncenter"><img src="http://orig13.deviantart.net/ffe3/f/2015/278/1/3/10___the_wheel_of_fortune___mekhane__broken_god__by_sunnyclockwork-d9c0m2n.jpg" title="X - The Wheel of Fortune: Mekhane/The Broken God" alt="X - The Wheel of Fortune: Mekhane/The Broken God" width="400" class="image" /></div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> <h3><span>XI - Justice: SCP-1730 - What Happened to Site-13?</span></h3> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">+&nbsp;Show&nbsp;image</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">-&nbsp;Hide&nbsp;image</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"> <div style="border: 1px solid #000;"> <div style="height: 100%;"> <div class="image-container aligncenter"><img src="http://orig06.deviantart.net/e062/f/2015/278/6/3/11___justice___scp_1730_by_sunnyclockwork-d9c0m5f.jpg" title="XI - Justice: SCP-1730 - What Happened to Site-13?" alt="XI - Justice: SCP-1730 - What Happened to Site-13?" width="400" class="image" /></div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> <h3><span>XII - The Hanged Man: The Hanged King [SCP-701]</span></h3> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">+&nbsp;Show&nbsp;image</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">-&nbsp;Hide&nbsp;image</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"> <div style="border: 1px solid #000;"> <div style="height: 100%;"> <div class="image-container aligncenter"><img src="http://orig03.deviantart.net/522e/f/2015/278/8/b/12___the_hanged_man___the_hanged_king_by_sunnyclockwork-d9c0m88.jpg" title="XII - The Hanged Man: The Hanged King [SCP-701]" alt="XII - The Hanged Man: The Hanged King [SCP-701]" width="400" class="image" /></div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> <h3><span>XIII - Death: Three Death Brothers [SCP-1440]</span></h3> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">+&nbsp;Show&nbsp;image</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">-&nbsp;Hide&nbsp;image</a></div> <di